digitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ρ-type1.html\">Ρ type1\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ρ-type1.1.html\">Ρ type1.1\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Χ-type3.html\">Χ type3\u003C/ref>\n                                \u003C/p>\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line1\">Line 1\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cdimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                                    \u003Cheight unit=\"mm\"/>\n                                \u003C/dimensions>\n                            \u003C/handNote>\n                        \u003C/handDesc>\n                    \u003C/physDesc>\n                    \u003Chistory>\n                        \u003Corigin>\n                            \u003CorigPlace>\u003Cregion>Sicilia\u003C/region>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"ancient\" ref=\"http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462074\">Adranon\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"modern\" ref=\"http://sws.geonames.org/2525769\">Adrano\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003Cgeo>37.66358, 14.83283\u003C/geo>\n                            \u003C/origPlace>\n                            \u003CorigDate datingMethod=\"#julian\" notBefore-custom=\"-0300\" notAfter-custom=\"-0201\" evidence=\"archaeological-context\">third century BCE\u003C/origDate>\n                        \u003C/origin>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"found\" subtype=\"discovered\" when=\"1980\">Recovered in 1980 as a result of illegal excavation on via Grosseto immediately to the south-east of  archaeologically investigated hellenistic housing in an insula on 'strada 1', proprieta Lazzaro-Di Guardia.\u003Cgeo>37.6601158,14.8270854\u003C/geo>\u003C